// The Pink Valley tag-along co-op: Ella as a player character.
// Her sprites only face the camera, but SHEA A-I are her turning from her back to her front,
// so they make the rotations of a new sprite, TPEL. These only point at the mod's own
// graphics; nothing is copied. Frames B and C are the walking bob (raised a few pixels).

