// Weapon icons over players' heads (sprite TPWI, frames A-S; the table is in zscript.zs,
// BuildWeaponIcons). Each one points at the weapon's own pickup picture, cut to the picture and
// anchored at its bottom middle. They're scaled to about the same amount of picture (a 14x14
// square's worth) so long guns and chunky things look alike in size, never wider than 26 units
// and never taller than 18. The mod's LZS and Pib card have no picture of their own, so those
// two are in graphics/.

// SAWOFF (chainsaw)
Sprite "TPWIA0", 76, 22
{
	XScale 2.923
	YScale 2.923
	Offset 38, 22
	Patch "CHAWA0", 0, 0
}

